d joins <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/german-east-africa">German East Africa</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1931</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/belgium">Belgium</a> deposes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yuhi-v-musinga">Musinga</a> and installs <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mutara-iii-rudahigwa">Mutara III Rudahigwa</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1959</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mutara-iii-rudahigwa">Mutara III</a> dies and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hutu">Hutu</a> revolution begins</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1961</span><span class="rf-text">A UN-supervised referendum confirms the abolition of the monarchy</span></li></ol>
